[00:56:17.580 --> 00:56:42.560]   that into the next bid, so I, I'd say that, absolutely, that, um, schedules, and how, how you make it through the siting process, and all of that, uh, informs, um, you know, subsequent bids, and, um, so I can assure you that all those things get, get, you know, up to the minute, uh, attention before we goes in.
[00:56:42.560 --> 00:56:47.560]   Okay, got it, um, that's helpful, and I just wanted to touch on, um, just O&M costs and the
